{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のびてきた。3本の。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーミンのニョキニョキみたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全握のリハでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣を見たらスタッフさんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パソコンの入れ物が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーミンのニョキニョキのイラストで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもわず「あっ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと声を出してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰ってもう一度ちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーミンのキャラクターを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"検索しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニョキニョキじゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニョロニョロでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんニョロニョロ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず今日も苔かわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り道が楽しかったーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんるんるんるんるんるんる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回個人PVが無くなったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかは、また個人PVを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってみたいと思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvで私を知ってくださった方や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しになってくださった方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多いので、また機会があれば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人で撮影できるのって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい良い経験だし嬉しいので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな去年悔しい思いしてる\n今年のプリンシパルはどうでした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は去年のプリンシパル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出したくないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"deuxは一幕の内容的にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年より精神的に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し楽になったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり辛いし悔しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその分自分に自信がついたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい発見もあったし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう形の公演は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のグループに絶対やらせたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のものにしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生クリームって簡単に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗い流せるものなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3回くらい髪洗った笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生クリームは美味しかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の曲でまりかのお気に入りは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コウモリよ、他の星から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハの前に幼なじみの親友と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃべりしたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽だなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心していっぱいしゃべったなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ゆったん／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握楽しみだなーふっふー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/05/3493397/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}